ABOUT THE DATA SOURCE

This Work documents and automates the publicly accessible pages of
tenders.procurement.gov.ge. It contains no credentials and accesses no
authenticated or non-public endpoints. The procurement data itself is published
by the State Procurement Agency of Georgia and is subject to that agency's own
terms. This license covers only the documentation and software in this
repository, not the underlying public data.

THE WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. The portal may
change at any time; endpoints and selectors documented here carry a
"last verified" date and are not guaranteed to remain accurate.
